Underwriting guidelines (INS-UW-03)

Issuer: Poisťovňa Devín, a. s. · IČO 00 682 447 · Pribinova 10, 811 09 Bratislava

Bind cover only inside your written authority; anything above the limit is referred to the underwriting manager.
The applicant must answer the written questions truthfully. Under §799 and §802 of the Civil Code, a material misstatement lets the insurer reduce or refuse the benefit, and in serious cases withdraw from the contract.
Aggregate exposure is checked before binding property risks in flood-prone areas along the Danube, the Morava and the Bodrog, and before accumulating hail exposure in the east.
Motor third-party liability is compulsory and cannot be declined for an eligible vehicle; pricing and excesses are the only levers.
A declination records a clear underwriting reason in the file, and the applicant is told the decision without an implication of dishonesty.
Product terms are reviewed against the product oversight rules before any change reaches the market.

